From: nvb-uy <105564560+nvb-uy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] comdlg32: Complete portal save names like the Explorer dialog.

A name typed without extension gets the one of the chosen file type or the default extension, OnOverwrite is sent when that name exists, GetFileName returns the name without folder, and the results are made from simple ID lists so nothing has to be created on disk for a new file. Folder pickers send no file types.
---
